<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Bash on diamon@truediamon.ru:~$</title><link>https://truediamon.ru/tags/bash/</link><description>Recent content in Bash on diamon@truediamon.ru:~$</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ru-ru</language><copyright>Содержимое доступно по лицензии [Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 Creative Commons](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/deed.ru)</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2008 17:51:59 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://truediamon.ru/tags/bash/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Как настроить автоматический запуск screen при входе по ssh</title><link>https://truediamon.ru/content/kak-nastroit-avtomaticheskiy-zapusk-screen-pri-vhode-po-ssh/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2008 17:51:59 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://truediamon.ru/content/kak-nastroit-avtomaticheskiy-zapusk-screen-pri-vhode-po-ssh/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Достало постоянно вводить &lt;code&gt;screen -dR&lt;/code&gt; при входе на удалённую машину. Погуглив нашёл простое решение. В конце &lt;code&gt;~/.bashrc&lt;/code&gt; дописать:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight-wrapper"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight-toolbar"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="highlight-lang"&gt;bash&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;button type="button" class="highlight-copy" data-copied="Скопировано"&gt;Копировать&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt; -z &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$STY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;then&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;exec&lt;/span&gt; screen -dR&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;fi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>